{"shell.main_menu.shell-tutorial-help","Learn the settlement from five gnomes to a working civilization."},
{"tutorial.explanation","Use the real settlement tools to complete this lesson. The tutorial only advances when the game state confirms it."},
{"tutorial.action.continue","Continue"},{"tutorial.action.skip","Skip"},{"tutorial.action.restart","Restart"},{"tutorial.action.hints","Hints"},{"tutorial.action.show_hints","Show hints"},{"tutorial.action.hide_hints","Hide hints"},{"tutorial.action.finish","Continue anyway"},
{"tutorial.incompatible.title","Tutorial unavailable"},{"tutorial.incompatible.explanation","This save was created with a tutorial scenario version this build cannot guide. Your world is preserved; continue normally or restart with a current tutorial scenario."},
{"tutorial.step.orientation","Orientation"},{"tutorial.step.inspect_assign","Inspect and assign"},{"tutorial.step.shelter_storage","Shelter and storage"},{"tutorial.step.mining_levels","Mining and levels"},{"tutorial.step.farming","Farming"},{"tutorial.step.crafting","Crafting"},{"tutorial.step.cooking","Cooking"},{"tutorial.step.population","Population expansion"},{"tutorial.step.graduation","Graduation"},
{"tutorial.objective.orientation","Pan, zoom, rotate, change level, pause, resume, and change speed."},{"tutorial.objective.inspect_assign","Select a gnome, inspect it, open Population and Inventory, then change an assignment."},{"tutorial.objective.shelter_storage","Build a shelter with five beds and create a stockpile."},{"tutorial.objective.mining_levels","Mine the marked wall, remove a floor, and connect the lower level."},{"tutorial.objective.farming","Designate a farm, choose a crop, plant, and harvest it."},{"tutorial.objective.crafting","Build the Crude workshop and produce a Plank."},{"tutorial.objective.cooking","Build the Kitchen, make Flour, then make Bread."},{"tutorial.objective.population","Accept the migration prompt and grow from five to eight gnomes."},{"tutorial.objective.graduation","Review the checklist and continue into the normal simulation."},
{"tutorial.steps_heading","Do this"},
{"tutorial.steps.orientation.pan","Drag the map with the left mouse button to pan."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.zoom","Use the mouse wheel to zoom the map."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.rotate","Use the configured rotate controls or the rotate command when available."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.level","Click Z- and Z+ to visit another level, then return."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.pause","Click Pause, then click Resume to practice stopping the simulation."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.speed","Click Fast, then Normal, to change simulation speed."},
{"tutorial.steps.inspect.select","Click one of the five gnomes on the map."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.inspect","Open the selected gnome's inspector."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.population","Open Population from the HUD."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.inventory","Open Inventory from the HUD."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.assignment","Change one work assignment or profession."},
{"tutorial.steps.shelter.build","Open Build and choose a simple plank wall or floor."},{"tutorial.steps.shelter.room","Place enough pieces to enclose a small room."},{"tutorial.steps.shelter.beds","Place all five starter beds inside the shelter."},{"tutorial.steps.shelter.stockpile","Open Designations, choose Stockpile, and mark storage space."},
{"tutorial.steps.mining.open","Open Mine and choose the marked wall order."},{"tutorial.steps.mining.wall","Drag across the marked wall to mine through it."},{"tutorial.steps.mining.floor","Choose Remove floor and mark the practice shaft."},{"tutorial.steps.mining.stairs","Build or mine a stair connection to the lower level."},
{"tutorial.steps.farming.designate","Open Agriculture or Designations and create a farm."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.crop","Select the tutorial crop in the farm controls."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.plant","Let a farmer till and plant the marked plot."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.harvest","Wait for the mature crop to be harvested."},
{"tutorial.steps.crafting.build","Open Build, choose Workshops, and place a Crude workshop."},{"tutorial.steps.crafting.recipe","Open the workshop queue and choose Plank."},{"tutorial.steps.crafting.collect","Let a crafter finish, then confirm the new plank in Inventory."},
{"tutorial.steps.cooking.kitchen","Build the Kitchen workshop."},{"tutorial.steps.cooking.flour","Queue FlourKitchen and wait for flour to be produced."},{"tutorial.steps.cooking.bread","Queue Bread and wait for the finished loaf."},
{"tutorial.steps.population.prompt","Wait for the migration question to appear."},{"tutorial.steps.population.accept","Answer Yes on the migration prompt."},{"tutorial.steps.population.confirm","Confirm the population reaches eight gnomes."},
{"tutorial.steps.graduation.review","Review the checklist and any skipped lessons."},{"tutorial.steps.graduation.continue","Choose Continue anyway to leave tutorial guidance and keep playing."},
